{%- set fg_name = dr_failover_group_name | default('DR') %}
{%- set target = dr_target_account | default('TARGET_ACCOUNT') %}
{%- set approver = dr_event_approver | default('VP Engineering') %}
{%- set channel = dr_communication_channel | default('#incident') %}
{%- set rto = dr_rto_target | default('30') %}
{%- set rpo = dr_rpo_target | default('10') %}
{%- set enable_redirect = dr_enable_client_redirect | default('No') %}

## DR Runbook: {{ fg_name }}

### 1. Event Declaration

**Trigger Criteria:**
- Snowflake region outage confirmed (check status.snowflake.com)
- Outage duration exceeds {{ rto }} minutes
- OR: Scheduled DR drill

**Decision:**
- On-call escalates to {{ approver }}
- {{ approver }} declares DR event
- Notification sent to {{ channel }}

### 2. Snowflake Failover Steps

1. Suspend replication: `ALTER FAILOVER GROUP {{ fg_name }} SUSPEND;`
2. Promote to primary: `ALTER FAILOVER GROUP {{ fg_name }} PRIMARY;`
{%- if enable_redirect == 'Yes' %}
3. Redirect clients: `ALTER CONNECTION {{ fg_name }}_CONN PRIMARY;`
{%- endif %}
4. Resume warehouses: `ALTER WAREHOUSE <name> RESUME;`

### 3. Manual Steps Outside Snowflake

- Repoint ETL/ELT pipelines to target account
- Update BI tool connections
- Recycle application connection pools
- Verify external storage access from target region

### 4. Replication Exceptions

Objects requiring manual recreation:
- External tables
- Event tables
- Hybrid tables
- Databases from inbound shares
- PrivateLink / Private Link endpoints
- MFA enrollment

### 5. Validation Checklist

- [ ] Failover group shows as primary on target
{%- if enable_redirect == 'Yes' %}
- [ ] Client redirect resolves to target account
{%- endif %}
- [ ] Critical databases accessible
- [ ] Row counts pass on key tables
- [ ] Warehouses resumed
- [ ] ETL pipelines running
- [ ] BI dashboards functional
- [ ] Non-replicated objects recreated

### 6. Communication Templates

**DR Event Declared:**
Subject: [DR EVENT] Snowflake failover initiated
Target: {{ target }}. Estimated recovery: {{ rto }} minutes.

**Recovery Complete:**
Subject: [DR RESOLVED] Failover complete
RPO achieved: {{ rpo }} minutes. All services on {{ target }}.

**Failback Complete:**
Subject: [DR FAILBACK] Restored to original primary
